WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.350
The Kuiper Belt beyond Neptune is home
to icy worlds like Arrokoth.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.950
Some of its most distant objects have
orbits that point in similar directions.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.900
In 2016, astronomers proposed that

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.050
gravity from a hypothetical Planet Nine
could explain that alignment.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:18.100
So where might Planet Nine be?

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.350
Brighter tiles on our map show
higher estimated probability.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.420
Pick a marked region,
open its case file,

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:25.510
and vote on whether
it’s worth taking a closer look.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.650
Then compare the evidence
for and against Planet Nine

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.900
to see why astronomers
are still debating it.
